  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 16 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDiscover this substantial GJ Gardner brick and tile residence, elevated to capture the views and sun.\r\n\r\nThis home delivers effortless single level style and comfort, and generous proportions for growing or established families.  Designed with both everyday living and formal entertaining in mind, the thoughtfully laid out floor plan offers multiple distinct living zones. Host guests in the elegant formal lounge or gather together in a spacious open plan family room with dining area, kitchen and access to the back garden.\r\n\r\nThe primary suite has an ensuite and walk in wardrobe, plus 3 double bedrooms. \r\n\r\nOn a freehold 767 m² section, the garden is established with a variety of fruit trees, raised garden beds and there is plenty of room for parking extra vehicles.  \r\n\r\nSet in a sought after Orewa pocket just minutes from the golden sands of Orewa Beach, local cafes, motorway access and schools. This beautiful home combines coastal convenience with peaceful privacy.",
